            "review_title": "Review at Dong Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Coastal16449573534\n1 contribution\n0\nReal Authentic Vietnamese Delicious food\nAug 2023 • Solo\nthis restaurant is a gem in a residential area, The owner of the restauranr is a very friendly young lady she makesw sure all her guests feel extremely welcome I have to mention that all the Vietnamese people i have meetover the last couple of days have all been very friendly I have visited a few restaurants and coffe shops and learned that sevice has to be teached normally you need to be patient to place an order and wait a long time before you got served Thanh Dong is a different story the owner is serving the tables by herself and her service is very good The Delicious food is of high quality and all is very fresh authentic andtastythe prices are low and the value for money is exeptional if you want to try some real Authentic Vietnamese food thenIhighly recommend this restaurant I will be back to enjoy another lovely meal\nRead more\nWritten August 13, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
